  Original workflow request: crea un workflow para coger los emails que vaya recibiendo y que los clasifique por nivel de urgencia con IA
  Workflow objective: User requested a new workflow for: crea un workflow para coger los emails que vaya recibiendo y que los clasifique por nivel de urgencia con IA
  Desired outcome: Deliver an abstract workflow plan that satisfies: crea un workflow para coger los emails que vaya recibiendo y que los clasifique por nivel de urgencia con IA
  Workflow summary: Abstract workflow plan for incoming email urgency classification with automatic intake semantic classification and source-side label application.
  Current stage id: stage_apply
  Current stage name: Apply Urgency Label in Gmail
  Stage purpose: Apply the resulting urgency level back onto the same Gmail message as a visible label so the user can filter it later.
  Stage required capabilities: Update the original email item, Apply a visible urgency label or equivalent source-side marker
  Stage expected inputs: Urgency classification result, Source email identifiers
  Stage expected outputs: Source email updated with urgency label
  Stage dependencies: stage_processing
  Previous stage node selections: stage_intake: n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap | stage_processing: n8n-nodes-base.aiTransform
  Clarifications already provided:
  -
  Retrieval focus hint: Prefer nodes that mutate the source item directly, such as adding labels or tags, moving folders, archiving, or updating source-side state. Reject trigger-only or read-only nodes.
