query_text:
  Original workflow request: crea un workflow para coger los emails que vaya recibiendo y que los clasifique por nivel de urgencia con IA
  Workflow objective: User requested a new workflow for: crea un workflow para coger los emails que vaya recibiendo y que los clasifique por nivel de urgencia con IA
  Desired outcome: Deliver an abstract workflow plan that satisfies: crea un workflow para coger los emails que vaya recibiendo y que los clasifique por nivel de urgencia con IA
  Workflow summary: Abstract workflow plan for incoming email urgency classification with automatic intake semantic classification and source-side label application.
  Current stage id: stage_processing
  Current stage name: Classify Email Urgency with AI
  Stage purpose: Interpret the subject and body semantically with an AI model and assign one urgency level.
  Stage required capabilities: Read the normalized email payload, Assign an urgency level such as low, medium, high, or critical
  Stage expected inputs: Normalized email payload with subject and body
  Stage expected outputs: Urgency classification result
  Stage dependencies: stage_intake
  Previous stage node selections: stage_intake: n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap
  Clarifications already provided:
  -
  Retrieval focus hint: Prefer AI-capable main-path classification nodes such as OpenAI, Ollama, Mistral, AI Transform, or text-classifier style nodes. Reject plain triggers, inbound listeners, and unrelated email provider nodes for classification.
